  while (at < end)
    {
      len = *(at++);
      if (len > (gsize) (end - at))
        break;
      g_ptr_array_add (array, g_strndup ((gchar *)at, len));
      at += len;
    }
```

This reads 1 byte at a time, so no 12-byte read.

